<Policy title="Cookies" description="How the Dominion Christian Connections website uses cookies." updated="October 2026">
  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>This website does not use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies, so we don't need to ask for your consent.</p>
  <h2>Third-party content</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Background videos</strong> at the top of some pages are hosted on this website and set no cookies.</li>
    <li><strong>YouTube videos</strong> (sermons and messages) use YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode and only load when you press play. YouTube may then set cookies under its own policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Forms</strong> (contact, prayer requests and others) are provided by Jotform and shown on our pages. Jotform may set cookies that are needed for the form to work, under its own policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Online giving</strong> takes you to Stripe's secure payment page, which uses cookies that are essential for payment and fraud prevention.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If we add website analytics in future, we will ask for your consent first and let you change your choice at any time.</p>
</Policy>
